lation:</strong> Your decisions move numbers and narratives: jobs, prices, trust, ideology, stability, and turnout.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cascading crisis engine:</strong> Every choice can trigger strikes, scandals, market shocks, diplomatic meltdowns, or regime-level instability -- there's no &quot;safe build&quot;.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf4e You are the President -- and the temptation is real</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can try to govern as a reformer. You can play as a ruthless pragmatist. Or you can rewrite the rules entirely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The question isn't whether power can change a country.<br>It's whether power will change <strong>you</strong>.</p>","developers":["Water Wood Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3677060/73a11666f597ee43d4402bbbfac6b4470c57356e/header.jpg?t=1770406577","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple Silicon<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> We recommend Apple Silicon for the best performance. x86-64 systems are supported as well.<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 800 MB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple Silicon<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Apple Silicon<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 800 MB available space</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3677060/1749004045/b0c